{
  "text": "```verilog\nmodule sync_wedge #(\n    parameter STAGES = 2\n)(\n    input  clk_i,\n    input  rst_ni,\n    input  en_i,\n    input  serial_i,\n    output r_edge_o,\n    output f_edge_o,\n    output serial_o\n);\n\n    localparam SYNC_STAGES = (STAGES < 2) ? 2 : STAGES;\n\n    reg [SYNC_STAGES-1:0] sync_reg;\n    reg                   prev_sync;\n\n    wire sync_bit = sync_reg[SYNC_STAGES-1];\n\n    assign serial_o = sync_bit;\n\n    wire rising  = sync_bit & ~prev_sync;\n    wire falling = ~sync_bit & prev_sync;\n\n    assign r_edge_o = en_i & rising;\n    assign f_edge_o = en_i & falling;\n\n    integer i;\n    always @(posedge clk_i or negedge rst_ni) begin\n        if (!rst_ni) begin\n            sync_reg <= {SYNC_STAGES{1'b0}};\n            prev_sync <= 1'b0;\n        end else begin\n            sync_reg[0] <= serial_i;\n            for (i = 1; i < SYNC_STAGES; i = i + 1)\n                sync_reg[i] <= sync_reg[i-1];\n            prev_sync <= sync_bit;\n        end\n    end\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
